  "name": "Business Entity Filings",
  "description": "This Draft Standard for Trial Use contains the format and establishes the data contents of the Business Entity Filings Transaction Set (105) for use within the context of an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) environment. This bi-directional transaction set can be used by business entities, governmental administrators and regulators to exchange required business entity filing information, such as annual reports, registered agent changes and changes of officers, partners and directors, and may include information about any required fees.",
